        "subject": "LU-20411 lnet: annotate functions that hold ln_api_mutex",
        "message": "LU-20411 lnet: annotate functions that hold ln_api_mutex\n\nClang 22 with kernel 7.1 can statically enforce locking\nannotations like __must_hold(). Fix violations for the\nthe_lnet.ln_api_mutex by adding annotations to functions\nthat omit them. This fixes various -Wthread-safety-analysis\nwarnings.\n\n[1] https://docs.kernel.org/dev-tools/context-analysis.html\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ifcba5a7f3aef4b711db0b7970470cd0307b36036\n"
      },
